## Multiplayer Networking

### Client-Server Architecture

```cpp
// Server authoritative movement
void MoveCharacter(FVector input) {
    if (IsServer()) {
        // Server processes movement
        Position += input * Speed * DeltaTime;
        ReplicateToClients(Position);
    } else {
        // Client sends input to server
        ServerRPC_MoveCharacter(input);
    }
}
```

### Latency Compensation

- Client prediction
- Server reconciliation
- Lag compensation

## Performance Optimization

### Profiling

```cpp
// Measure function time
auto start = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();
ExpensiveFunction();
auto end = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();
auto duration = std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(end - start);
UE_LOG(LogTemp, Warning, TEXT("Function took %d ms"), duration.count());
```

### Target Performance

- **PC**: 60 FPS minimum
- **Console**: 30-60 FPS
- **Frame Budget**: 16.67ms @ 60 FPS

